{
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "CarryDictionary MCP server: expose your local dictionary to any MCP/AI client (beta on Windows)",
  "homepage": "https://github.com/HalkPapa/homebrew-carrydictionary",
  "license": "Freeware",
  "architecture": {
    "64bit": {
      "url": "https://github.com/HalkPapa/homebrew-carrydictionary/releases/download/cd_mcp-v0.1.0/cd_mcp-0.1.0-windows-x86_64.zip",
      "hash": "16e0cc39ac41821bb153bdf591f7504ce3bd46c6078bdd6bcfb21121acccc704"
    }
  },
  "bin": "bin\\cd_mcp.exe",
  "notes": [
    "cd_mcp is an MCP stdio server. Register it with an MCP client and set CD_DB_PATH.",
    "Claude Code (.mcp.json): {\"mcpServers\":{\"carry-dictionary\":{\"command\":\"cd_mcp\",\"env\":{\"CD_DB_PATH\":\"C:/path/to/cd_core.sqlite\"}}}}",
    "If CD_DB_PATH is unset it defaults to %APPDATA%\\CarryDictionary\\cd_core.sqlite",
    "Windows support is BETA.",
    "Beta feedback / bug reports: https://github.com/HalkPapa/homebrew-carrydictionary/issues",
    "Free & Apache-2.0 — support: https://github.com/sponsors/HalkPapa"
  ],
  "checkver": {
    "github": "https://github.com/HalkPapa/homebrew-carrydictionary",
    "regex": "cd_mcp-v([\\d.]+)"
  },
  "autoupdate": {
    "architecture": {
      "64bit": {
        "url": "https://github.com/HalkPapa/homebrew-carrydictionary/releases/download/cd_mcp-v$version/cd_mcp-$version-windows-x86_64.zip"
      }
    }
  }
}
